{
    "name": "dsh-agent-toolface",
    "version": "0.3.0",
    "description": "工具面分档：在 agent 作用域内按证据化的 deny 集收窄模型可见工具（lean/full/domain 切换 + 审计留痕），降低工具 schema 的固定上下文成本与选择稀释。v0.3 起支持多域（open 累加 / close 移除），status 报每域成本与「域外地板」，让切域从盲选变成可算。",
    "type": "module",
    "main": "lib/index.js",
    "types": "lib/types/index.d.ts",
    "exports": {
        ".": {
            "types": "./lib/types/index.d.ts",
            "default": "./lib/index.js"
        },
        "./package.json": "./package.json"
    },
    "files": [
        "lib",
        "README.md",
        "dsh-plugin.json"
    ],
    "license": "MIT",
    "peerDependencies": {
        "@deepseek-ai/cordis": "^4.0.1",
        "@deepseek-ai/schemastery": "^3.18.1-rc.1",
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-tools": ">=0.1.0-rc.6"
    },
    "devDependencies": {
        "@types/node": "^22.0.0",
        "typescript": "^5.9.3"
    },
    "scripts": {
        "prepare": "tsc -p tsconfig.json",
        "build": "node node_modules/typescript/bin/tsc -p tsconfig.json",
        "typecheck": "node node_modules/typescript/bin/tsc -p tsconfig.json --noEmit",
        "test": "node --test \"tests/*.test.mjs\""
    }
}
